[{"id":"lr-double-stage1","title":"LR修复第一步：为什么先左旋16？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">LR路径转折处需要先调整失衡祖先的左孩子，才能进行后续有效右旋。</p><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>原始30、16、20结构</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LR0\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"304\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text><circle cx=\"304\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"304\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">20是16的右孩子，根30仍失衡。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>第一步：对16左旋</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRmid\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">20成为30的左孩子，16变成20的左孩子。</p></div></div><p class=\"d17-note\">此时只是双旋的中间状态，不应称作已恢复平衡；下一步还需要对30右旋。</p></div>","goal":"明确双旋第一步作用及其尚未完成状态","activity":"连续结构推演","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"lr-double","title":"LR修复第二步：为什么再右旋30？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"d17-cols\"><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>左旋后的中间树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRmid\"><line x1=\"320\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"215\" y2=\"145\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"145\" x2=\"115\" y2=\"242\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"215\" cy=\"145\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"242\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">30仍存在高度差，需要第二步。</p></div><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>第二步右旋后的最终树</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"LRdone\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"164\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"50\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"158\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"50\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"58\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"164\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"164\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">16</text><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"158\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">局部根20，两个孩子分别为16和30。</p></div></div><div class=\"d17-formula\">中序仍为16 → 20 → 30；每个结点的BF均为0</div><p class=\"d17-note\">旋转的两个动作分别改变了什么链接？如何检验它们都合法？</p></div>","goal":"理解双旋完整步骤及其顺序与平衡正确性","activity":"第二步旋转与性质检验","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"mirror-cases","title":"RR和RL怎样通过对称性理解？","section":"avl","role":"content","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><p class=\"d17-lead\">先理解单旋与双旋的机制，再根据左右对称性总结四种路径。</p><table class=\"d17-table\"><thead><tr><th>插入路径</th><th>需要的操作</th><th>机制关系</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>LL 左→左</td><td>对失衡祖先右旋</td><td>单旋</td></tr><tr><td>RR 右→右</td><td>对失衡祖先左旋</td><td>LL的左右镜像</td></tr><tr><td>LR 左→右</td><td>先左旋左孩子，再右旋祖先</td><td>双旋</td></tr><tr><td>RL 右→左</td><td>先右旋右孩子，再左旋祖先</td><td>LR的左右镜像</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"d17-note\">这里针对AVL插入后的最低失衡祖先；AVL删除会出现不同的维护条件，不机械套用。</p></div>","goal":"由LL与LR推导插入失衡的四类结构调整","activity":"对称归纳与条件界定","withheld_results":[]},{"id":"independent-avl","title":"新树插入27，如何定位并修复失衡？","section":"avl","role":"exercise","body":"<div class=\"d017\"><div class=\"course-workspace d17-workspace\" data-course-component=\"task-workspace\"><div class=\"course-input\" data-task-input><div class=\"d17-panel\"><h3>初始合法AVL（独立输入）</h3><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AVL0\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"159\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"410\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"159\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"48\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"159\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"159\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"410\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">40</text><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">10</text><circle cx=\"240\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"240\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">25</text></svg><p class=\"d17-note\">根30，左20(10,25)，右40，尚未插入27。</p></div></div><div class=\"course-task\"><div class=\"course-prompt\" data-task-prompt><div class=\"d17-question\">① 按BST规则插入27；② 判断是否失衡并定位；③ 画出必要旋转后的树，分别检验有序与平衡。</div></div><details class=\"course-answer\" data-task-answer><summary>核对答案与理由</summary><div class=\"course-solution\"><p>27先插入25的右空链接。沿路径向上检查，最低失衡祖先为30，左孩子20的BF为−1。</p><p>先对20左旋，再对30右旋：</p><svg class=\"d17-tree\" viewBox=\"0 0 540 355\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"AVLdone\"><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"155\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"270\" y1=\"48\" x2=\"408\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"155\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"346\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"408\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"477\" y2=\"248\" stroke=\"#7792ab\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"48\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#d7edf9\" stroke=\"#175f91\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">25</text><circle cx=\"155\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">20</text><circle cx=\"408\" cy=\"138\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"408\" y=\"146\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">30</text><circle cx=\"78\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">10</text><circle cx=\"346\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"346\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">27</text><circle cx=\"477\" cy=\"248\" r=\"27\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#7795ae\" stroke-width=\"2.3\"/><text x=\"477\" y=\"256\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#1b4160\">40</text></svg><p>最终根25，左子树20(10)，右子树30(27,40)；中序10、20、25、27、30、40，所有相关结点|BF|≤1。</p></div></details></div></div></div>","goal":"在新输入上独立完成AVL插入、失衡判定和旋转","activity":"先独立完成，再核对","withheld_results":["最终根25","左孩子20的BF为−1"]}]